    "body": "Currently we don't deal with OOM and crashes are a variant of that. In both cases it \"ideally doesn't happen\". I've seen suggestions that OOM should be standardized in some way at some point and perhaps always result in \"crashing\" the agent cluster. If that were to happen this would be needed.\r\n\r\ncc @mystor @lars-t-hansen @erights",
