    "updated_at": "2025-04-11T02:31:23Z",
    "body": "See [Don't Remember Panicking](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-oom-fails-fast/tree/master) stage 1 Update ([keynote slides](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-oom-fails-fast/blob/master/panic-talks/dont-remember-panicking.key), [pdf slides](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-oom-fails-fast/blob/master/panic-talks/dont-remember-panicking.pdf))\n\nto be presented as a Stage 1 Update at the [tc39 plenary next week](https://github.com/tc39/agendas/blob/main/2025/04.md). I believe my presentation will address many of these issues. It proposes adding a HostFaultHandler host hook through with browsers and other hosts can express policy about how they handle such faults.",
